# The static dashboard and Phase 2 analyzer require no credentials.
# Phase 3 local PostgreSQL uses ignored .local/durable/connection.json and
# .local/durable/migration-connection.json with host, port, database, user, password.
# Host must be the literal IPv4 loopback address. Do not commit either file.
# Alternatively set DRIFT_DB_HOST, DRIFT_DB_PORT, DRIFT_DB_DATABASE,
# DRIFT_DB_USER and DRIFT_DB_PASSWORD in the trusted process environment.
# Migration commands additionally use DRIFT_MIGRATION_USER and DRIFT_MIGRATION_PASSWORD.
# No credentials or connection settings are exposed to the static dashboard.
# Next.js telemetry is disabled only for child processes by scripts/next.mjs.
